## Manifests

This directory contains the Kustomize bundle for the `{{ app_name }}` application.
ArgoCD syncs it as part of the App-of-Apps tree (see `k8s/gitops/apps-root.yaml`).

| Resource | File | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Namespace | `namespace.yaml` | Isolates the app's resources |
| Deployment | `deployment.yaml` | Runs the container with resource limits |
| Service | `service.yaml` | ClusterIP, exposes port {{ container_port }} |
{% if needs_ingress %}
| Ingress | `ingress.yaml` | Tailscale ingress at `{{ ingress_hostname }}` |
{% endif %}
{% if needs_pvc %}
| PVC | `pvc.yaml` | {{ pvc_size }} persistent storage |
{% endif %}

